      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, margin",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>The people of al-Ma\u1e25alla know how weakened</li>\n<li>my situation is and how very poor I am.</li>\n<li>I have been in Fustat a month</li>\n<li>and have no[t] burdened anyone. Were it not for my exigency</li>\n<li>I would not [need to turn t]o you. May God</li>\n<li>the exalte[d make your h]igh [excellency]</li>\n<li>one of the besought [not a be]s[eecher],</li>\n<li>a refuge for the wretched and down and out and</li>\n<li>the needy p[oo]r.</li>\n<li><i>Amen, great salvation. </i></li>\n<li><i>And peace.</i></li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
